## **When to Use Linked List?**
| **Condition** | **Use Linked List?** |
|--------------|------------------|
| When **size is unknown** | ✅ Yes |
| **Fast insert/delete needed** | ✅ Yes |
| **Fast searching required** | ❌ No (use arrays or HashMap) |
| **Memory efficiency needed** | ❌ No (extra space for pointers) |

