## **Summary**
🔹 **Linked List is a data structure where each node has data + pointer to the next node.**  
🔹 **3 types:** **Singly, Doubly, Circular.**  
🔹 **Operations:** **Insertion, Deletion, Searching, Traversal.**  
🔹 **Pros:** **Dynamic size, fast insertion/deletion.**  
🔹 **Cons:** **Extra memory, slow search.**  

🔸 **Use Linked List when dynamic memory and fast insert/delete are needed!** 🚀
